## Required follow-up before executable status

1. Specify the exact standard-library contracts for line input, EOF, tokenization, UTF-8/string handling, and output.
2. Specify checked Int64 arithmetic, especially `MIN / -1` and truncation toward zero.
3. Ensure parser behavior rejects extra tokens and out-of-range values without intermediate overflow.
4. Implement and run every task test scenario.
